<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Souza Cruz raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Souza Cruz raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analyst Dana Voelzke has raised his rating for Brazilian cigarette maker Cia Souza Cruz Industria e Comercio SA, the Brazilian subsidiary of Britain's B.A.T Industries Plc, to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Our earnings estimates for FY97 and FY98 assume exports will grow 12.5 percent and 9.2 percent, respectively, as cigarette sales to emerging markets ... expand,&quot; he wrote in a May 5 report.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company rose 0.06 real to 9.01 reais in Sao Paulo.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
